  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1002.65 Senior housing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1002.65 “Senior housing” means housing that qualifies as “housing for older persons” as specified in RSA 354-A:15, as reprinted in Appendix F.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1002.62)",
